      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad ensure zero scratches during Bike Transportation In Lalganj Azamgarh?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We use hydraulic ramp trailers equipped with anti‑slip rubber mats and secure wheel‑belt tie‑downs, then wrap each bike in our patented 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging. The combination of gentle loading, custom wooden crates for delicate parts, and real‑time monitoring eliminates any chance of surface damage throughout the journey.</p>
