        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I book a bike parcel service online through IRCTC for a move from Lalganj Azamgarh?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, our platform integrates with IRCTC’s bike parcel booking system, allowing you to schedule a rail‑based bike shipment directly from Lalganj. The process includes entering bike details, selecting a preferred train, and receiving a confirmed e‑way bill. Our team then handles packaging, insurance, and door‑to‑door handover.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are premium and sports bikes handled differently from commuter bikes during transportation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Premium and sports bikes receive extra care: we build reinforced wooden crates, add high‑density foam around engine components, and use double‑layer bubble wrap. Commuter bikes follow the standard 7‑layer protocol, which still meets our zero‑scratch guarantee but with a slightly lighter crate to optimize space.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation is required for Bike Transportation In Lalganj Azamgarh, especially for corporate reimbursements?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need a valid government‑issued ID, bike registration certificate, GST‑compliant invoice, and a signed insurance declaration. For corporate claims, we also provide a detailed transit report, e‑Way bill, and a signed delivery receipt that meets the requirements of Central/State Government and PSU reimbursement policies.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the hydraulic ramp trailer load and unload two‑wheelers safely?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The ramp extends at a controlled speed, aligning perfectly with the truck floor. Operators position the bike on the ramp, secure it with wheel‑belt tie‑downs, and gently drive it onto the enclosed container. Unloading mirrors the process in reverse, ensuring the bike remains upright and undamaged throughout.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike in real time while it travels from Lalganj to the destination hub?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Our GPS‑enabled fleet provides live location updates every 15 minutes via a customer portal or SMS alerts. You’ll see exact route progress, estimated arrival time, and any stoppage points, giving you full visibility for your Bike Transportation In Lalganj Azamgarh shipment.</p>
